// Capsule sales/billing — compile entry for Invoice + Payment + PaymentMethod.
// CollectionCase / PaymentRefundAttempt / InvoiceLine are not modeled yet (OD040).
// Deposits implemented per deposit-tracking feature (2026-07-21).
// EventCancelled voids unpaid draft/sent/viewed/overdue invoices (D041).

use "./payment.manifest"

// An approved event gets one unsent draft Invoice from its quoted price, and
// only when that price is more than zero (AC-618). A reaction cannot skip a
// zero price, so the authored seam convex/lib/invoicePricingReconciliation.ts
// (ensureEventDraftInvoice) makes it on EventApproved, and on a later price
// change when the event still has no invoice, through Invoice.issue with
// invoiceSequence: 0 (auto-numbered, #136 / #165) and the accepted proposal
// and revision as the commercial source. It never sends the draft.

// The transactional operational callback voids eligible unpaid invoices through
// Invoice.markVoided. Paid/partial/voided/written-off invoices and payments stay
// recorded; event cancellation does not imply a refund.
